  "rationale": "The predeclared complete-caller gate fails: nine significant reductions do not offset six significant regressions. Both five-unique/MVP-wins cases regress12.24\u201317.70%, and all four all-distinct cases regress15.98\u201318.85%. All twelve fallback controls are inconclusive. Keep the candidate out of main; no cutoff tuning or timing repeat follows this one bounded experiment. Diagnostic repeated-SAD counts were real, but removing those evaluations does not guarantee a faster complete search.",
  "correctness": "Full encoder, all six required focused race tests, full CPU-disabled tests and ARM64 compilation passed. All408 timed samples allocated zero bytes. These are component correctness checks, not a full candidate stream/decoder gate.",
